# Rekoto

Use Superpowers, UI UX Pro Max, Marketing skills, and No AI slop.

## Product

- Brand name is **Rekoto** (Sesotho-leaning “record”; never Loom / Capora / loom_clone in UI).
- Local-only recorder. No cloud claims.
- Windows desktop + Chrome/Edge/Firefox companion extensions.

## Recording UX

- Feedback within ~300ms of Start (Preparing or countdown).
- Countdown digits sync after overlay is visible.
- On stop, keep UI visible (“Saving…”) while restore + encode run.

## Browser privacy

- Mask + crop need the extension connected.
- Broadcast tracking during preparing.
- Chrome’s own password UI is not maskable — say so honestly in Settings.

## UI

- SaaS shell: sidebar brand + product nav + sticky top bar + workspace chip.
- Follow `design-system/rekoto/MASTER.md`. Plus Jakarta Sans. No Inter.
